stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: gateCheck
    lg1: review
    lg2: allow
    lg3: pending
    lg4: summary
    lg5: done
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 purple
  class lg2 teal
  class lg3 orange
  class lg4 yellow
  class lg5 tan
  s0: Gate: Idle (等待权限请求)
  s1: Gate: CheckHard (机械红线检查)
  s2: Gate: CheckAllowOnce (校验 allow_once)
  s3: PendingHuman (hard -> ask)
  s4: PendingHuman (gate-error 异常降级 -> ask)
  s5: Summary: Collecting (待记录调用)
  s6: Gate: CheckReviewEnabled (检查审批可用性)
  s7: PendingHuman (no-allow-option -> ask)
  s8: Summary: Collecting (已记 Read omitted)
  s9: Gate: JevPreScreen (Jev 前筛)
  s10: Gate: ZCodeFast (Stage 1 快筛)
  s11: PendingHuman (review-disabled -> ask)
  s12: Summary: Collecting (Read+Write omitted)
  s13: Gate: ZCodeSlow (Stage 2 慢判)
  s14: AutoAllowed (review-fast -> allow)
  s15: PendingHuman (review-failed 异常降级 -> ask)
  s16: Summary: Backfill Slot 1 (Read 仅查 Read 队列)
  s17: Summary: Collecting (已收 Write permission.requested)
  s18: AutoAllowed (review-slow -> allow)
  s19: PendingHuman (review-slow -> ask)
  s20: Summary: Backfill Slot 2 (Write 查 Write 队列)
  s21: Emitted (Read=none, Write=none)
  s22: Emitted (Read=none, Write=perm_Write)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: 收到 interaction/requestPermission
  s1 --> s2: 红线通过
  s1 --> s3: 命中红线 -> ask
  s1 --> s4: 闸门异常 -> 安全降级 ask
  s2 --> s4: 闸门异常 -> 安全降级 ask
  s2 --> s7: 无 allow_once -> ask
  s2 --> s6: 存在 allow_once
  s3 --> s5: 人工 deny -> deny or 人工 approve -> allow
  s4 --> s5: 人工 deny -> deny or 人工 approve -> allow
  s5 --> s8: 记录 Read(inputOmitted)
  s6 --> s4: 闸门异常 -> 安全降级 ask
  s6 --> s9: 启用 Jev 前筛
  s6 --> s10: 直入 Stage 1
  s6 --> s11: 审批不可用 -> ask
  s7 --> s5: 人工 deny -> deny
  s8 --> s12: 记录 Write(inputOmitted)
  s9 --> s10: Jev flag/skip/error -> Stage 1
  s9 --> s14: Jev pass -> allow
  s9 --> s4: 闸门异常 -> 安全降级 ask
  s10 --> s13: parseFast=flag -> Stage 2
  s10 --> s14: parseFast=pass -> allow
  s10 --> s4: 闸门异常 -> 安全降级 ask
  s10 --> s15: Stage 1 异常 -> review-failed ask
  s11 --> s5: 人工 approve -> allow or 人工 deny -> deny
  s12 --> s16: 开始同名工具回填
  s12 --> s17: 收到 Write 的 permission.requested
  s13 --> s4: 闸门异常 -> 安全降级 ask
  s13 --> s15: Stage 2 异常 -> review-failed ask or parseSlow 畸形/解析失败 -> review-failed ask
  s13 --> s18: parseSlow=allow -> allow
  s13 --> s19: parseSlow=ask -> ask or parseSlow=deny(有效规则) -> 映射 ask or parseSlow=deny(无/假规则) -> 降级 ask
  s14 --> s5: 自动应答 allow
  s15 --> s5: 人工 approve -> allow or 人工 deny -> deny
  s16 --> s20: Read 不借 Write 输入 (保持 none)
  s17 --> s16: 开始同名工具回填
  s18 --> s5: 自动应答 allow
  s19 --> s5: 人工 approve -> allow or 人工 deny -> deny
  s20 --> s21: Write 无审批输入保持 none
  s20 --> s22: Write 命中同队列回填 perm_Write
